      "created_at": "2015-12-14T18:26:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'd argue that since they used the word \"and\" instead of \"then\" it would occur at the same time. Meaning, you get to choose who gets damaged first. I'm not familiar with the text on the Scholar variant so I can't speak to the video game but as a rule when it comes to software, especially newly released content, bugs do crop up.</p>",
